g-&gt;p : parseStudyTasks(text)
p.&gt;g : dated tasks
g: validatePlan(plan)
--
g:Check dates, positive minutes, daily budgets and diagnostic order
g-&gt;r : savePlan(valid plan)
r.&gt;u : actual saved schedule or explicit error
g:An exhausted invalid proposal does not overwrite an earlier plan</panel_attributes>
